одился на Украине. После начала Великой Отечественной войны принимал участие в строительстве оборонительных укреплений...</span></div></div></div></li><li class="lAEUQazXMFdVI lAEUQazXMFdVINpY9kfA " data-leekg="4" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw009" data-lfuerbw="1" data-lfuerbw-name="images" data-lfuerbw-subtype="intent"><div class="Root Root_inited" id="ImagesScroller__16xe82u5fonyvm3ignx37-Vc0q62J" data-state-id="2_gv0r0"><div class="ImagesScroller"><button class="lJUEM4nTJAOJACJYo Extralinks Extralinks_id_2_gv0rw02-0-11 Extralinks_hidden Extralinks_hidden Extralinks_position_topRight Extralinks_relative UniSearchHeader-Extra" id="2_gv0rw02-0-11" aria-label="Действия" aria-haspopup="menu" data-lbu4o="{&quot;uniqId&quot;:&quot;2_gv0rw02-0-11&quot;,&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;variant&quot;:&quot;reportFeedback&quot;,&quot;reportFeedback&quot;:{&quot;feature&quot;:&quot;Тематический блок картинок&quot;,&quot;checkBoxLabels&quot;:[{&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Несоответствие запросу&quot;},{&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Порнография&quot;},{&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Шокирующая или неприятная информация&quot;},{&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Недостоверная информация&quot;},{&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Удалите мое фото&quot;,&quot;requireEmail&quot;:true},{&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Другое&quot;}],&quot;customMetaFields&quot;:[{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;docId&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;4&quot;},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;1.&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;https://yastatic.net/naydex/yandex-search/17syk1l00/b89cd0G1QW-/2ufTp9EH5QogubXrUB8pHORS5vTPZcwBRXW1xdSuPovLOrgOh7IZUVxrUd7_fEBJol239__FInsppCUhEcYVuosw1XRHVHFOM6nkrsYK-FrxUOY1j-KbUYEyo0TD6K4cyOjuGRAnTQpFtgwC8SMMQn9DPWTqhuOu7rcxMssfw&quot;},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;2.&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;https://yastatic.net/naydex/yandex-search/17syk1l00/b89cd0G1QW-/2ufTp9EH5QogubXrUB8pHORS5vTPZcwBRXW1xdSuPovdrXgPE3PPhBxrkF4rPcAcosgjoz_Qt249ZOeg0ESAbotnAeDEQ3Bac6glrocLe5txUOY1j-KbUYEyo0TD6K4cyOjuGRAnTQpFtgwC8SMMQn9DPWTqhuOu7rcxMssfw&quot;},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;