ection class="FuturisGPTMessage"><section class="FuturisGPTMessage-GroupContent"><h3 class="A11yHidden">Содержимое ответа</h3><div class="FuturisGPTMessage-GroupContentComponentWrapper"><div class="FuturisMarkdown FuturisMarkdown_theme_common" translate="no"><div data-end-streaming-block="true"></div><div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph"><strong class="FuturisMarkdown-Strong">Василь Владимирович Быков</strong> (19&nbsp;июня 1924&nbsp;—&nbsp;22&nbsp;июня 2003)&nbsp;—&nbsp;советский и белорусский писатель, общественный деятель, участник Великой Отечественной войны, член Союза писателей СССР. Один из крупнейших представителей «лейтенантской прозы»&nbsp;—&nbsp;литературного течения, которое сосредоточено на изображении войны через призму личного опыта фронтовиков.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%91%D1%8B%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2,_%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C_%D0%92%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-47" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.wikipedia.org?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.wikipedia.org</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.ruwiki.ru/wiki/%D0%91%D1%8B%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2,_%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C_%D0%92%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-49" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.ruwiki.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.ruwiki.ru</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://xn--h1ajim.xn--p1ai/%D0%91%D1%8B%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2,_%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C_%D0%92%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-4b" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://xn--h1ajim.xn--p1ai?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>руни.рф</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://yarsklib.ru/_doc/collegam/2024/Vojna_i_sud'by.pdf" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-4d" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://yarsklib.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>yarsklib.ru</span></a></div>
<h3 class="FuturisMarkdown-Heading">Биография</h3>
<div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph">Родился в деревне Бычки Ушачского района Витебской области в крестьянской семье. С детства увлекался рисованием. После окончания 7&nbsp;классов школы учился на скульптурном отделении Витебского художественного училища, но в 1940&nbsp;году был вынужден оставить учёбу из-за отмены стипендий. Затем обучался в школе фабрично-заводского обучения (ФЗО), где получил строительную специальность.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%91%D1%8B%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2,_%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C_%D0%92%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-4f" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.wikipedia.org?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.wikipedia.org</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.ruwiki.ru/wiki/%D0%91%D1%8B%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2,_%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C_%D0%92%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-4h" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.ruwiki.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.ruwiki.ru</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://tass.ru/encyclopedia/person/bykov-vasil-vladimirovich" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-4j" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://tass.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>tass.ru</span></a></div>
<div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph">В начале Великой Отечественной войны был мобилизован на оборонительные работы. Летом 1942&nbsp;года призван в Красную армию, окончил Саратовское пехотное училище, получил звание младшего лейтенанта. Воевал на 2-м и 3-м Украинских фронтах, был дважды ранен. Участвовал в боях за освобождение Кривого Рога, Александрии, Знаменки, в Ясско-Кишинёвской операции. С действующей армией прошёл по Болгарии, Венгрии, Югославии, Австрии.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.ruwiki.ru/wiki/%D0%91%D1%8B%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2,_%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C_%D0%92%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-4l" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.ruwiki.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.ruwiki.ru</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://tass.ru/encyclopedia/person/bykov-vasil-vladimirovich" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-4n" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://tass.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>tass.ru</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://www.nlb.by/content/news/po-stranitsam-belorusskogo-kalendarya/narodnyy-pisatel-velikoy-otechestvennoy/" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-4p" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://www.nlb.by?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>nlb.by</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://rodina-history.ru/2024/06/19/ia-vsegda-pisal-o-tom-chto-videl-i-perezhil-sam.html" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-4r" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://rodina-history.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>rodina-history.ru</span></a></div>
<div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph">После демобилизации в 1955&nbsp;году жил в Гродно, работал в художественных мастерских и в редакции газеты «Гродненская правда». С 1959&nbsp;года&nbsp;—&nbsp;член Союза писателей СССР.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.ruwiki.ru/wiki/%D0%91%D1%8B%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2,_%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C_%D0%92%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-4t" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.ruwiki.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.ruwiki.ru</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://www.nlb.by/content/news/po-stranitsam-belorusskogo-kalendarya/narodnyy-pisatel-velikoy-otechestvennoy/" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-4v" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://www.nlb.by?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>nlb.by</span></a></div>
<h3 class="FuturisMarkdown-Heading">Творчество</h3>
<div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph">Большинство произведений Быкова&nbsp;—&nbsp;повести, действие которых происходит во время Великой Отечественной войны. В них показан нравственный выбор человека в наиболее драматичные моменты жизни. Писатель стремился показать «окопную правду»&nbsp;—&nbsp;неприкрашенную картину военных будней, увиденную глазами младшего офицера. Он не приукрашивал войну, запечатлел её ежедневный ужас, кровь и жестокость.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%91%D1%8B%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2,_%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C_%D0%92%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-4x" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.wikipedia.org?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.wikipedia.org</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://xn--h1ajim.xn--p1ai/%D0%91%D1%8B%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2,_%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C_%D0%92%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-4z" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://xn--h1ajim.xn--p1ai?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>руни.рф</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://www.litres.ru/author/vasiliy-bykov/about/" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-411" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://www.litres.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>litres.ru</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://eksmo.ru/articles/proza-vasilya-bykova-05-26-ID16116886/" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-413" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://eksmo.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>eksmo.ru</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://yarsklib.ru/_doc/collegam/2024/Vojna_i_sud'by.pdf" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-415" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://yarsklib.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>yarsklib.ru</span></a></div>
<div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph"><strong class="FuturisMarkdown-Strong">Некоторые известные произведения:</strong></div>
<ul class="FuturisMarkdown-UnorderedList"><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0">«Третья ракета» (1961)&nbsp;—&nbsp;принесла писателю известность;&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%91%D1%8B%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2,_%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C_%D0%92%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-417" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.wikipedia.org?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.wikipedia.org</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.ruwiki.ru/wiki/%D0%91%D1%8B%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2,_%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C_%D0%92%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-419" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.ruwiki.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.ruwiki.ru</span></a></li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0">«Альпийская баллада» (1963);&nbsp;</li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0">«Мёртвым не больно» (1965)&nbsp;—&nbsp;одна из самых жёстких повестей автора;&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://eksmo.ru/articles/proza-vasilya-bykova-05-26-ID16116886/" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-41b" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://eksmo.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>eksmo.ru</span></a></li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0">«Сотников» (1970);&nbsp;</li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0">«Обелиск» (1971);&nbsp;</li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0">«Дожить до рассвета» (1972);&nbsp;</li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0">«Знак беды» (1982)&nbsp;—&nbsp;за эту повесть Быков получил Ленинскую премию;&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://vk.ru/wall-154212920_2379" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-41d" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://vk.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>vk.ru</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://cyclowiki.org/wiki/%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C_%D0%92%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87_%D0%91%D1%8B%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-41f" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://cyclowiki.org?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>cyclowiki.org</span></a></li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0">«Облава» (1990)&nbsp;—&nbsp;о белорусской деревне 1930-х&nbsp;годов, коллективизации и раскулачивании.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%91%D1%8B%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2,_%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C_%D0%92%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-41h" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.wikipedia.org?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.wikipedia.org</span></a></li></ul>
<div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph">Большинство произведений Быков писал на белорусском языке, многие из них сам переводил на русский. При этом русскоязычные версии не всегда были точными переводами&nbsp;—&nbsp;одна из причин в том, что цензура могла искажать их.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%91%D1%8B%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2,_%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C_%D0%92%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-41j" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.wikipedia.org?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.wikipedia.org</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://yarsklib.ru/_doc/collegam/2024/Vojna_i_sud'by.pdf" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-41l" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://yarsklib.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>yarsklib.ru</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.ruwiki.ru/wiki/%D0%91%D1%8B%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2,_%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C_%D0%92%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-41n" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.ruwiki.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.ruwiki.ru</span></a></div>
<div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph">В более поздних произведениях автор обращался к проблемам соотношения исторического времени и индивидуальных судеб героев.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://www.litres.ru/author/vasiliy-bykov/about/" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-41p" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://www.litres.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>litres.ru</span></a></div>
<h3 class="FuturisMarkdown-Heading">Награды и звания</h3>
<ul class="FuturisMarkdown-UnorderedList"><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0">Герой Социалистического Труда (1984);</li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0">народный писатель Белорусской ССР (1980);</li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0">Ленинская премия (1986&nbsp;—&nbsp;за повесть «Знак беды»);</li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0">Государственная премия СССР (1974&nbsp;—&nbsp;за повести «Дожить до рассвета» и «Обелиск»);</li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0">Государственная премия Белорусской ССР имени Якуба Коласа (1978&nbsp;—&nbsp;за повести «Волчья стая», «Его батальон»).</li></ul>
<div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph">&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://vk.ru/wall-154212920_2379" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-41r" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://vk.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>vk.ru</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://xn--h1ajim.xn--p1ai/%D0%91%D1%8B%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2,_%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C_%D0%92%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-41t" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://xn--h1ajim.xn--p1ai?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>руни.рф</span></a></div>
<div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph">Также был награждён орденами Ленина, Трудового Красного Знамени, Красной Звезды, Отечественной войны I&nbsp;степени, Дружбы народов и многочисленными медалями.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://tass.ru/encyclopedia/person/bykov-vasil-vladimirovich" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-41v" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://tass.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>tass.ru</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://xn--h1ajim.xn--p1ai/%D0%91%D1%8B%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2,_%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C_%D0%92%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-41x" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://xn--h1ajim.xn--p1ai?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>руни.рф</span></a></div>
<h3 class="FuturisMarkdown-Heading">Общественная деятельность</h3>
<div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph">Василь Быков был депутатом Верховного Совета БССР 9–11&nbsp;созывов, народным депутатом СССР. Являлся членом правления Союза писателей СССР и Союза писателей Беларуси, членом республиканского Совета Фонда мира.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%91%D1%8B%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2,_%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C_%D0%92%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-41z" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.wikipedia.org?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.wikipedia.org</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://www.nlb.by/content/news/po-stranitsam-belorusskogo-kalendarya/narodnyy-pisatel-velikoy-otechestvennoy/" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-421" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://www.nlb.by?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>nlb.by</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://xn--c1anggbdpdf.xn--p1ai/history/202251/" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-423" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://xn--c1anggbdpdf.xn--p1ai?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>посткомсг.рф</span></a></div>
<h3 class="FuturisMarkdown-Heading">Наследие</h3>
<div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph">Произведения Василя Быкова переведены более чем на 50&nbsp;языков мира. По ним сняты художественные фильмы, написаны пьесы, радиоспектакли. Среди известных экранизаций&nbsp;—&nbsp;картины «Третья ракета», «Альпийская баллада», «Дожить до рассвета», «Восхождение» (по повести «Сотников») и другие.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://yarsklib.ru/_doc/collegam/2024/Vojna_i_sud'by.pdf" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-425" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://yarsklib.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>yarsklib.ru</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://xn--c1anggbdpdf.xn--p1ai/history/202251/" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-427" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://xn--c1anggbdpdf.xn--p1ai?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>посткомсг.рф</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://www.nlb.by/content/news/po-stranitsam-belorusskogo-kalendarya/narodnyy-pisatel-velikoy-otechestvennoy/" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-429" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://www.nlb.by?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>nlb.by</span></a></div>
<div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph">В 2014&nbsp;году в посёлке Ждановичи-6 (недалеко от Минска) открылся Музей-дача Василя Быкова&nbsp;—&nbsp;филиал Государственного музея истории белорусской литературы.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://yarsklib.ru/_doc/collegam/2024/Vojna_i_sud'by.pdf" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-42b" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://yarsklib.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>yarsklib.ru</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://cyclowiki.org/wiki/%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C_%D0%92%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87_%D0%91%D1%8B%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-42d" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://cyclowiki.org?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>cyclowiki.org</span></a></div>
<div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph">Имя писателя носят улицы в нескольких городах Беларуси.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%91%D1%8B%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2,_%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C_%D0%92%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-42f" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.wikipedia.org?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.wikipedia.org</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://yarsklib.ru/_doc/collegam/2024/Vojna_i_sud'by.pdf" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-42h" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://yarsklib.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>yarsklib.ru</span></a></div></div></div></section><div class="FuturisGPTMessage-GroupScrollerWrapper"><div class="Scroller Scroller_sameHeight Scroller_scrollDirection_none Scroller_hasArrows Scroller_hasArrows Scroller_theme_futuris FuturisGPTMessage-GroupScroller" data-lh08fpnbkbdu="2_gv0rw0f-0-42i"><div class="Scroller-Container"><div class="ArrowButton ArrowButton_direction_left ArrowButton_hidden ArrowButton_withShadows Scroller-Arrow"></div><div class="Scroller-Wrap"><div role="list" class="Scroller-ItemsWrap"><div class="FuturisActionsPanel"><div class="FuturisActionsPanel-ActionsBlock"><div class="FactFeedback FuturisFeedback"><div class="FuturisFeedback-ButtonWrapper"><h4 class="A11yHidden">Оценить ответ</h4><div class="FactFeedback-ButtonWrap"><button aria-label="Понравилось" type="button" class="Button Button_pin_circle-circle FactFeedback-Reaction